=\"33\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">33</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Samuel Cunard bid for the British mail contract because he believed steamships would get</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q33\" data-q=\"33\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 33, faster.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>faster.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q33\" data-q=\"33\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 33, stronger.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>stronger.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q33\" data-q=\"33\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 33, more reliable.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>more reliable.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q34\" data-q=\"34\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">34</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">After Samuel Cunard won the British mail contract he</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q34\" data-q=\"34\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 34, reduced his fleet of ships.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>reduced his fleet of ships.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q34\" data-q=\"34\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 34, set up a new company.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>set up a new company.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q34\" data-q=\"34\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 34, appointed British agents.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>appointed British agents.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q35\" data-q=\"35\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">35</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Samuel Cunard chose Boston as a destination for his mail service because</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><i